      "html": "† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">אָמֹץ</span>]</big>  <strong>adj. forte</strong>, somente no plural <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲמֻצִּים</span> acerca de cavalos <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 6:3\" href=\"/Zechariah.6.3\">Zc 6:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 6:7\" href=\"/Zechariah.6.7\">7</a> (no v. <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 6:7\" href=\"/Zechariah.6.7\">7</a> talvez se deva ler <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲדֻמִּים</span>, cf. v. <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 6:2\" href=\"/Zechariah.6.2\">2</a>, e Hi; veja outra interpretação em Lag<sup>BN 29</sup>).",
