      "preview": "אֲמַצְיָ֫הוּ: Amazias, rei de Judá, e outros portadores do nome.",
      "html": "<big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲמַצְיָ֫הוּ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲמַצְיָה</span></big>  <strong>s.pr.m. (</strong><span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>é poderoso</em><strong>)</strong>.<br><strong>1.</strong>  rei de Judá, filho de Joás e pai de Azarias; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲמַצְיָהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:1\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.1\">2 K 14:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:9\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.9\">9</a> + 8 ocorrências em <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14\" href=\"/II_Kings.14\">2 K 14</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 15:3\" href=\"/II_Kings.15.3\">15:3</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.12\">1 Ch 3:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:27\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.27\">2 Ch 24:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.1\">25:1</a> + 15 ocorrências em <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25\">2 Ch 25</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.1\">26:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.4\">4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲמַצְיָה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:22\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.22\">2 K 12:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:12\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.12\">13:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.8\">14:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 15:1\" href=\"/II_Kings.15.1\">15:1</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲמַצְיָה</span>, um simeonita <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:34\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.34\">1 Ch 4:34</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>idem</em>, um levita <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:30\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.30\">1 Ch 6:30</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  sacerdote de Betel, no reinado de Jeroboão II, <a data-ref=\"Amos 7:10\" href=\"/Amos.7.10\">Am 7:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Amos 7:12\" href=\"/Amos.7.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Amos 7:14\" href=\"/Amos.7.14\">14</a>.",
